00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:18.080
Because that strikes me as probably the hardest way to get into a history book short of winning the presidency.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:24.740
It's humbling. Certainly I had no idea when this case started that this would ever happen.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:28.400
Had no way of knowing that we would be at the U.S. Supreme Court but

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.400
to know that our name will forever be on
a court case at the u.s supreme court

